# API Routes: App Router Only

All API endpoints must live in the **App Router** under `app/`. Do not use the Pages Router (`pages/api`).

```text
// ❌ BAD
pages/api/users.ts

// ✅ GOOD
app/api/users/route.ts
```

- Place handlers in `app/api/**/route.ts` (or `route.js`)
- Export HTTP methods as named exports (`GET`, `POST`, `PUT`, `PATCH`, `DELETE`)
- Prefer Route Handlers over creating a parallel `pages/` API structure
